pyseekdb does not bundle third-party code. Its direct runtime dependencies are
installed separately; they are listed in THIRD_PARTY_COMPONENTS.md with their
constraints, licenses and the location of their license texts. Transitive
dependencies are resolved at install time and ship their own license texts.

The embedded engine driver pylibseekdb ships its complete engine license
bundle under pylibseekdb/licenses/ in its wheel (from version 1.4.1).
Downstream redistributors must retain that bundle together with the pyseekdb
package.
